GUITAR MP3 TRANSCRIPTION - TESTER QUICK START
============================================

Goal:
Open the website, upload an MP3, and download a PDF and MusicXML file.

FASTEST WAY TO START
--------------------
1. Open a terminal in this folder
2. Run:

   python3 start.py

3. Open your browser to:

   http://127.0.0.1:8000

4. Upload an MP3 file
5. Click "Generate PDF"
6. Download the PDF and MusicXML from the page

WHAT YOU NEED INSTALLED
-----------------------
- Python 3.10+ recommended
- Internet access during first startup so Python packages can be installed

IF SOMETHING GOES WRONG
-----------------------
Common issue: dependency install fails.
If that happens, send the terminal error output back to the app sender.

TO STOP THE APP
---------------
Press Ctrl+C in the terminal.
